# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build & distribution artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dmg
*.pkg

# The viewer bundle is generated from viewer/src by `npm run build`.
# The Xcode project references it as a folder, so build it before xcodebuild —
# see "Building" in README.md. viewer/vendor is NOT ignored: three and the
# decoders are deliberately vendored so builds need no network.
viewer/dist/

